
ESP32-S31 Linux: RV32 at 320 MHz, 16 MiB PSRAM, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, LCD.

Wi-Fi     off by default (driver can freeze the box retrying auth).
          Enable: put wpa_supplicant.conf on /mnt/sd (p1), then
          /etc/init.d/S40wifi restart;   status: iw dev wlan0 link
Bluetooth bluetoothctl, then: scan le, scan bredr, devices
System    htop, free, df -h, dmesg
Network   ssh, scp, curl, links, iperf3, tcpdump
Files     /mnt/sd is the FAT partition of the card
Code      micropython, lua, vim, gdbserver, strace
Examples  ls /usr/share/examples

